K4 PASS edge 6 = 1.4186 Mpc = 1.372 r200c; r_sp = 1.3674 r200c |edge6/r200c - 1.3674| < 1% :: the bin edges are 0.150-0.218-0.317-0.461-0.671-0.976-1.419-2.063-3.000 Mpc = 0.145-0.211-0.307-0.446-0.649-0.943-1.372-1.995-2.901 r200c; the 6th edge lands within 0.4% of r_sp = 1.3674 r200c, so the step falls in the MID/OUTER boundary bin

