K21 PASS chi2 range over w = 0-0.22 dex: 8.28-9.62 range < 2 :: the eight bins DO NOT measure the transition width: chi2 varies by less than 2 over w = 0 to 0.22 dex (0 to 0.7 Mpc). Only the location (1.2-1.7 Mpc) and the amplitude jump are measured -- the 'step' is a step at the resolution of the CFG687 grid

