K22 PASS chi2_u(const) = 41.4 (A29: 41.5); chi2_u(u=1) = 575; u_in = 0.4116 |chi2-41.5|<2, chi2(u=1)/8>20, u_in in (0.35,0.48) :: the u-space estimator reproduces A29's constant-u chi2 (41.5) and the same u_in (0.412), so the DeltaSigma-space fits above are the same measurement with the correct (full-covariance) weighting; A29's 3-parameter step fit (chi2 = 8.98, 1.75/dof) recomputes to 8.73 (1.45/dof) here, so A29's number is confirmed to 0.25 in chi2

